      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INTEGRITY CATH (1) is a newcomer for the Robert Andrews kennel. Gets every chance from the inside draw. Has a nice profile and expected to measure up at first outing. BELLE GAMBLER (7) settled well back early on debut and but the line nicely when third (17.74) at this track over 300m. Can find the frame again this time. COOL MIST (2) is long overdue and boasts a solid record despite not having won her maiden yet, the latest finishing third at this track. Gave a big sight last time racing on speed much of the way. Comes through a solid form race last start. Leading chance. WAGGING RIGHTS (3) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
